FIELD SHIFT — Complete pixel-level website reconstruction specification
REFERENCE ANALYSIS · 1671 × 941 PX · DESKTOP LANDING PAGE · CINEMATIC GLASSMORPHISM

This design is a cinematic, full-screen agricultural intelligence landing page. Its visual identity combines a futuristic geospatial platform, a photorealistic nighttime agricultural landscape, luminous cyan and emerald accents, transparent glass navigation, and floating glass feature cards.

The most important thing about recreating this design is that the background, lighting, interface and typography must feel like one continuous visual environment. The interface should appear to float above the landscape rather than sit on top of a conventional website background.

The design has five major visual layers:
1. A full-screen cinematic nighttime landscape.
2. A dark atmospheric sky with a luminous moon and orbital geospatial graphics.
3. A floating navigation bar and large left-aligned hero section.
4. Four translucent glass feature cards arranged horizontally.
5. A subtle bottom scroll indicator integrated into the landscape.
The reference dimensions are 1671 × 941 pixels, approximately 16:9.

