9.3 Topographic contour pattern
One of the finer visual details is the subtle line-art pattern inside the cards.

It resembles geospatial elevation contour lines or a topographic map.

It is most noticeable in the upper-right portions of the cards.

It consists of thin, irregular curved concentric paths.

These lines should be extremely subtle, not bright decorative stripes.

Recommended opacity: 0.08–0.16.

Use an SVG background pattern or a transparent custom SVG asset.

Example:

<svg
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  viewBox="0 0 300 180"
  fill="none"
>
