14. Animation and visual interaction
The reference is visually dynamic but not excessively animated.

Use slow, restrained animations.
Element	Animation	Duration
Moon glow	Very subtle breathing	6 seconds
Orbital paths	Slow luminous movement	12 seconds
Navigation active indicator	Smooth transition	250 ms
Primary CTA	Glow increase on hover	200 ms
Feature cards	Slight upward movement	250 ms
Card borders	Subtle illumination	3 seconds
Card icons	Slight brightness increase	200 ms
Scroll arrow	Gentle vertical movement	1.5 seconds

Example:

@keyframes moonBreathing {
  0%, 100% {
    opacity: .8;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
  }

  50% {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.06);
  }
}

@keyframes scrollDown {
  0%, 100% {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  50% {
    transform: translateY(3px);
  }
}

.feature-card {
  transition:
    transform .25s ease,
    border-color .25s ease,
    box-shadow .25s ease;
}

.feature-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-5px);

  border-color: rgba(0, 205, 235, .65);

  box-shadow:
    0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .30),
    0 0 22px rgba(0, 173, 225, .20);
}

.primary-button {
  transition:
    filter .2s ease,
    transform .2s ease,
    box-shadow .2s ease;
}

.primary-button:hover {
  filter: brightness(1.12);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}



Avoid continuous rapid flashing, aggressive pulsing, and excessive movement.
